        "created_at": "2017-10-20T23:11:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>On it, boss!</p><p>-2 hours later-</p><p>Never mind, I can confirm what you said, but you have everything I can make out except a few things:</p><p>a) the parts of Athletic: Quickness, Agility, Strength, and Vitality.</p><p>b) More parts: Cold and Fire (Elemental), Magical Lore ad Otherworldly Mythos (Information), Creativity (Mental) Intelligence (Psychological) Flight (Mobility)</p><p>c) I think you missed the (very blurry) Experience category</p><p>d) Both of the non-parenthesised abilities under the Hallmark category have Signature in front of them. They look like Signature Vernicle and Signature Wisionary, but that can't be right, so use those as starting blocks if you want.</p><p>e) Are we just going to ignore the Struggling page? That seems like it will be pretty important.</p><p>Thanks for letting me have a crack at it! Sorry I wasn't much help.</p>",
