        "created_at": "2017-10-21T02:27:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think \"Information\" also has \"Criminal Underworld Info\", \"Medicine\", \"Science\", and \"Technology\" among its items.</p><p>Mobility seems to have \"Flight\", \"Swinging\", \"Transportation/Teleportation\" and \"Wall Climbing/Crawling\".</p><p>Psychic seems to have \"\"Astral (something)\", \"Hypnotic (something)\", \"Suggestion\", \"Telekinesis\", and \"Telepathy\".</p><p>Physical has \"Close Combat\", \"Firearms\", \"Finesse\", and \"Ranged Combat\".</p><p>I didn't ignore the \"Struggling\" section so much as admit I couldn't read much of anything useful on it. &gt;_&gt;;</p>",
